WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:41.680
<i>The Chosen Ones' new adventure has begun.</i>

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:45.480
<i>The Great Catastrophe that is said
to occur in the near future.</i>

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:48.020
<i>It is said that the key</i>

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:51.980
<i>to avoid this threat is to solve
the mystery of the eight crests.</i>

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>What will be lying in wait
beyond the Chosen Ones' journey?</i>

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:08.120
Look at that smoke!

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:11.040
It smells weird!

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:12.880
Yeah, you're right.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.780
Emergency rescue!

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.410
We're saved?

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:50.790
Looks like it.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:54.540
Jeez, that's not safety first!

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.340
Be careful!

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:58.720
JUNKMON

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:04.970
Alright! Everybody, get back
to your stations and resume operations!

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.060
Hurry but put safety first!

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:08.600
MUSHMON

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.890
Safety first!

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:11.700
BACOMON

00:03:13.730 --> 00:03:17.070
DANCE OF THE HEAVENS, HOUOUMON

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:21.200
How's the data recovery coming, Koshiro?

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:23.620
Looks like it'll take more time.

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:24.700
But...

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:28.200
<i>I'll make sure to find clues
about the Great Catastrophe!</i>

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.370
I'm counting on you, Koshiro!

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.710
<i>Thank you! I wish you luck too!</i>

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:34.540
-Hey, move it!
-Oh, sorry!

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:35.960
You're in the way!

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:38.210
You guys! Don't just stand around!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.010
We're busy here!

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:43.340
You're not putting safety first!

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:45.350
Safety first?

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:49.140
That's us Junkmon industry's motto!

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:50.890
Industry?

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:56.150
Hey guys! When you work...

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:59.150
Safety first!

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.740
Safety first!

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:04.160
Safety first!

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:08.160
Work? What are all of you doing?

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:11.660
What? Didn't you guys see from above?

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:16.170
This island's volcano sometimes
has small eruptions.

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:21.050
For everyone to survive on this island,
we gotta stop the lava with a wall

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:24.680
and change the flow of it.

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:27.100
Wow, that's real tough.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.810
They don't try to escape?

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:29.680
Yeah...

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:33.350
It's true that fighting nature
is troublesome,

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:37.360
but no one ever thinks
of leaving this island though.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:40.030
Everyone likes this island.

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.440
Right, everybody?!

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.200
Yeah!

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:47.700
But lately, the volcano's been acting up.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:53.540
My instincts say there's no mistake
a huge eruption's occurring soon.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:54.710
What?!

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:59.170
That's why we gotta hurry
and strengthen the walls.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:01.550
That's why everyone's so busy.

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:05.550
Oh! Taichi, let's help out too!

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:06.800
Yeah!

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:11.180
The more the merrier! Thanks!

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:13.680
Alright! I'm gonna work hard!

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.060
Me too!

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:16.560
However...

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:20.570
Always put safety first
when you're working!

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:22.820
Safety first!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:27.070
First, you gather materials for the wall
and transport them.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.490
There's quite a variety of stuff here.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:35.000
I wonder if this all came from our world?

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:35.960
Yeah...

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:38.790
Taichi, can you use this?

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:42.050
A manhole cover? I think so!

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:43.340
Yay!

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:45.800
Alright! Me too!

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:48.550
Piyomon!

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:51.100
Hey, now, don't rush!

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:54.100
Remember what I said!
When you work...

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:57.060
Safety first!

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:00.400
You transport all the materials.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.480
Safety first!

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:04.900
Safety first!

00:06:07.030 --> 00:06:09.320
You mix the cement.

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:12.490
And you pour that
onto the loaded materials.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.700
Once that hardens, it's done!

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:22.040
We increase the wall's height
and mend the breaks or cracks in it too.

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:23.630
Oh, hey!

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:28.220
There's a ton of work!
We're gonna have you guys work hard!

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:32.140
Hurry but put safety first, everyone!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:34.970
Safety first!

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:37.480
Here I go!

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.640
Safety first!

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:41.230
Nice catch!

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:45.980
Okay!

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:48.780
Good, very careful and well done!

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:50.780
Sora!

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:52.410
I got a compliment!

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:55.040
Alright, let's keep going!

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.790
I'm getting the hang of it now.

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:01.420
Yeah! It's getting kind of fun!

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:04.590
Don't relax just because
you're getting used to it!

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:05.920
When you work...

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:08.840
Safety first!

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:11.180
What is it?!

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:20.100
Alert!

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:26.940
Ow!

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:30.200
Sora!

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.450
Piyomon!

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.700
Piyomon!

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:45.250
Piyomon!

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:51.090
Leave it to me!

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:57.470
Piyomon!

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:00.770
Piyomon!

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:08.020
That should do it!

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:10.860
This isn't anything serious.

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:13.240
No, it must still hurt!

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:17.490
But I'm glad you weren't hurt, Sora.

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:19.040
Thank you.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:21.410
But please don't push yourself.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:22.330
Okay.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:26.170
Now I know why the wall needs
to be strengthened urgently.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:27.420
Yeah.

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:32.420
Before the huge eruption comes,
we gotta make it taller and stronger.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:34.180
Let's get on it right away!

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:35.930
I'm gonna work hard too!

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:38.180
Right! Let's do it!

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:39.060
Me too--

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:42.060
Wait a minute! No physical labor for you!

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:43.980
-What?
-That's right!

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.560
You stay and watch.

00:08:45.730 --> 00:08:46.810
But...

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:51.690
Don't worry!
I'll work hard for the both of us!

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.070
Leave it to me!

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:55.860
Taichi, Agumon, let's go!

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:56.870
-Okay!
-Yeah!

00:08:57.030 --> 00:09:00.080
Junkmon, give us lots and lots of work!

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:01.580
Alright!

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:05.080
But you guys are amateurs!
Make sure to put...

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:07.880
Safety first! Right?

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:09.460
I gotcha!

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:11.170
Now, come on!

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:12.800
Y-Yeah.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:15.720
Sora...

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.970
Out of the way!

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:21.890
Now, let's keep it going!

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:24.560
Leave the physical labor to me!

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:27.100
I'll help you out!

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:32.690
Easy! Easy!

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:36.490
Now, let's keep building it taller!

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:39.240
Since it's the wall to protect everybody!

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:41.740
Okay, let's do the next one!

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:46.660
Sora...

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:49.500
Hup!

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.090
Sora.

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:55.880
Piyomon.

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:58.340
You shouldn't be here. You need to rest!

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:01.390
I want to help too.

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:02.850
Let's do it together.

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:07.350
Then you two can carry
the materials together.

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:09.230
Okay!

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:11.060
Let's go, Sora!

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:16.610
Sora?

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:20.240
Junkmon told us to do it together.

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:21.870
Let's do it together.

00:10:22.030 --> 00:10:24.740
No! You're not completely healed yet.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:26.330
I'm fine already!

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:27.830
See? Look, look!

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.080
No!

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:32.170
What if you push yourself
and get hurt again?

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.340
What?

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:37.220
Sora, you've been doing
all this hard work too!

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:40.590
How come it's okay for you but not me?

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:42.220
Oh...

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:48.350
I'm saying this for your own good!

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:50.600
Why don't you understand?!

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:54.230
I'm worried about you too, Sora!

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:55.860
Please, let's both...

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:59.360
I said I'm fine by myself!

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:08.790
You know, this island's dangerous.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:10.000
That's why...

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:14.880
Why won't you trust me?

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:20.880
I hate you Sora!

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:28.680
Piyomon...

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:37.900
Sora...

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:40.240
I hate you Sora!

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:45.160
Sora...

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:52.370
Why won't you trust me?

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:59.550
You're not moving.

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:02.680
If you can't focus, take a break!

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:05.220
Or it won't be safety first!

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:08.600
Jeez, fighting over something petty.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:13.520
Junkmon, you do the dangerous tasks
alone too, right?!

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:18.190
That's because you care for everyone
and want to protect them, right?!

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:20.150
That's wrong.

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:21.030
What?

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:24.200
I'm the one being protected by them.

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:26.910
Those little ones and I...

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:32.540
If we both don't do our work properly,
this site can't run well.

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:37.960
In other words, this wall is made by
the trust between me and the little ones.

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:41.170
Trust...

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:48.970
We were...

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.390
<i>always together.</i>

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:53.640
<i>But now...</i>

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:58.270
She says she's fine by herself.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:01.730
Sora...

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:07.070
I need to apologize to Piyomon!

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.590
Alert!

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:23.590
Evacuate immediately!

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:35.850
It erupted!

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:40.730
The big one's finally here!

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:42.480
Evacuate!

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:43.360
Huh?!

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.820
Hey, what are you doing? Run!

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:49.120
But you're gonna protect them
with the wall, right?

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:51.870
The wall is there just to buy time to run!

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:56.000
When you're dealing with nature,
you put your life's safety first!

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:57.620
Let's go!

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:23.150
Let's save the Digimon
who couldn't escape!

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.110
Yeah!

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:29.070
Agumon Evolution!

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:36.410
Greymon!

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:43.500
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:52.220
Metalgreymon!

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:53.930
Let's go!

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:54.930
Yeah!

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.980
I have to go too!

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:03.610
Sora!

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:11.910
We came to save you!

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:13.530
Now, hop on!

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:24.840
Junkmon!

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:27.300
Hang in there!

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:31.550
Piyomon!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.160
Sora...

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.080
Sora...

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:06.340
Sora...

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:08.590
Sora!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:09.880
Piyomon!

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:13.340
I'm sorry for saying I hate you, Sora!

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:17.970
I was lonely...
I felt like I was being left behind.

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:24.600
I'm sorry too
for saying I'm fine by myself.

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:26.060
Yeah...

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:28.110
Sora!

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:32.530
We gotta take Junkmon and leave this area!

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:34.610
Please, Piyomon!

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:37.370
Okay, let's go!

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:43.960
Piyomon Evolution!

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.210
Birdramon!

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:54.800
Sora, you were okay!

00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:57.140
Take care of Junkmon please!

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.180
Alright.

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:00.680
What are you gonna do?

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:03.680
The lava might come here soon too!

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:10.320
We'll stop it!

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:11.940
That's impossible!

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:13.320
No!

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:15.660
We can do it!

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:19.120
Evacuate everyone to the ocean once.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:22.580
Good!

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.370
Let's go, Birdramon!

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:29.210
Birdramon Super Evolution!

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:37.010
Garudamon!

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:09.830
It's no good!

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:28.230
Sora, are you okay?

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:31.060
Yes, Garudamon.

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:37.280
If the two of us are together,
we can overcome any kind of danger.

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:41.120
Garudamon...

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:43.620
My dear Sora...

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:45.580
I trust in you!

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:56.710
Garudamon Mega Evolution!

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:11.650
Hououmon!

00:19:18.110 --> 00:19:20.380
HOUOUMON

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:26.240
Sora, your love has given me power!

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:31.370
Let's fly, Hououmon!

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.750
Higher!

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:34.290
Yes!

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:51.940
Amazing...

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:57.570
I've never seen anything like this before.

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:28.060
Taichi.

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:29.220
Yeah.

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:31.350
So beautiful...

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:35.810
Sora, thank you for trusting me.

00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:36.980
Yeah.

00:20:41.070 --> 00:20:42.530
Sora!

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:46.070
I love you, Sora!

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:48.780
Me too.

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:54.540
No change, huh...

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:57.840
Does this mean to continue forward?

00:20:58.250 --> 00:20:59.750
Ours is...

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:05.800
We can't tell which way to go.

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:06.680
Yeah...

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:10.180
Then how about you visit
the hot springs with me?

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:11.680
Hot springs?

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:16.520
Since the eruption finally settled,
I was thinking of recuperating there.

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:19.230
Taichi, isn't that maybe...

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:21.900
Yeah, Hikari and the others
might be there!

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:23.240
Let's go then!

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:25.070
Yeah, let's go!

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:33.040
<i>The border has now begun to blend</i>

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:33.040
<i>ima mazari atteku border</i>

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:35.870
<i>"It's uncharted territory from here!"</i>

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:35.870
<i>koko kara wa jinrui mitou desu!</i>

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:38.420
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:38.420
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:42.510
<i>All that you desire awaits you</i>

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:42.510
<i>nozomu kagiri no subete ga aru kara</i>

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:55.770
<i>The end doesn't exist, that's right</i>

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:55.770
<i>owari nanka nai ze sou sa</i>

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:58.440
<i>We're at our starting point right now</i>

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:58.440
<i>koko wa ima bokura no shuppatsuten</i>

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:01.070
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:01.070
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:04.650
<i>There's a tomorrow that no one knows about</i>

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:04.650
<i>dare mo shiranai asu wa aru kara</i>

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:06.650
<i>So keep on smiling</i>

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:06.650
<i>waratte iyou</i>

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:10.620
<i>We're past the point of stopping
In our daily lives</i>

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:10.620
<i>imasara tachidomarenu bokura no
nichijou jou</i>

00:22:10.780 --> 00:22:12.120
<i>Bring on the unknown!</i>

00:22:10.780 --> 00:22:12.120
<i>michi joutou!</i>

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:14.450
<i>That day, I drew on the wall with you</i>

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:14.450
<i>ano hi kimi to kabe ni kaita</i>

00:22:14.620 --> 00:22:17.080
<i>The incomplete, the imperfect</i>

00:22:14.620 --> 00:22:17.080
<i>mikansei wo fukanzen wo</i>

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:19.790
<i>"You can't go anywhere at this point"</i>

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:19.790
<i>imasara doko e mo ikenai ze tte</i>

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:22.500
<i>Oh, is that so?! Oh, is that so?!</i>

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:22.500
<i>aa sou kai nee! aa sou kai nee!</i>

00:22:22.670 --> 00:22:28.590
<i>Then we don't want to become a grown-up</i>

00:22:22.670 --> 00:22:28.590
<i>nara otona ni nanka natcha ikenai nee</i>

00:22:31.180 --> 00:22:32.850
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:35.270
<i>Hououmon.</i>

00:22:35.430 --> 00:22:38.520
<i>Garudamon mega evolves
into this golden Bird Digimon.</i>

00:22:35.430 --> 00:22:38.520
LEVEL: MEGA

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:40.940
TYPE: HOLY BEAST

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:43.190
<i>The special move,
Starlight Explosion, purges all evil!</i>

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:43.190
SPECIAL MOVE: STARLIGHT EXPLOSION

00:22:43.440 --> 00:22:46.280
-<i>Now, let's check myself out!</i>
-<i>Piyomon!</i>

00:22:46.440 --> 00:22:49.820
<i>With four wings now,
I feel like I could fly anywhere!</i>

00:22:49.990 --> 00:22:53.280
<i>But I can't break my habit,
so I feel odd flying with two.</i>

00:22:53.450 --> 00:22:54.950
<i>Oh, oh! I'm gonna fall!</i>

00:22:57.660 --> 00:22:59.960
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.540 --> 00:23:03.960
<i>The hot springs' ruler, Tonosamagekomon.</i>

00:23:04.130 --> 00:23:09.050
<i>Will Joe be able to save the captured
Gomamon and free the hot springs?</i>

00:23:09.220 --> 00:23:11.930
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Geko Hot Springs' Revolt"</i>

00:23:12.340 --> 00:23:14.760
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
